MODULE: DeleteReplayedAsSet
TARGET: ReplayAboveCursor
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: leaf re-replay re-ships a retained delete as a set, so the repair resurrects the key on the peer instead of deleting it
PERTURBS: ReReplay

--- FIND
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(r.k, r.ts, r.del) : r \in Selection}
--- REPLACE
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {RepairMsg(r.k, r.ts, FALSE) : r \in Selection}
--- END